cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this software, please cite the repository and the exact release or commit."
title: "EMK Materials Response: Lambda-Geometric Screening, Evidence Weighting, and Material Finality"
type: software
version: "0.1.0-rc1"
date-released: "2026-07-13"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dabas"
    given-names: "Monty"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6948-209X"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
abstract: >-
  A bounded public research implementation of a lambda-geometric materials-response
  framework covering single-material and lattice response, candidate screening,
  evidence and source weighting, candidate audits, machine-readable material
  certificates, append-only finality records, and standalone ledger verification.
keywords:
  - materials response
  - non-equilibrium materials
  - Onsager reciprocity
  - lambda geometry
  - material screening
  - evidence weighting
  - research certificates
  - append-only ledger
  - reproducible research
repository-code: "https://github.com/Parveen117/EMK-material-response-public"
